Third-party algorithm attribution
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. CAS (Contrast Adaptive Sharpening)

   Algorithm derived from AMD FidelityFX - CAS, version 1.20190610
   https://github.com/GPUOpen-Effects/FidelityFX-CAS

   Copyright (c) 2017-2019 Advanced Micro Devices, Inc. All rights reserved.
   Licensed under the MIT License (same terms as above).

   This project contains an INDEPENDENT IMPLEMENTATION written from the
   published algorithm description (the 5-tap cross kernel with adaptive
   negative lobe, as documented in ffx-cas/ffx_cas.h). No source code from
   FidelityFX-CAS is copied or included.

2. Lanczos and Catmull-Rom resampling kernels

   Classical image processing algorithms. The kernel definitions used here
   match the semantics of mpv's `--scale=lanczos` and `--scale=catmull_rom`
   options (Catmull-Rom: B = 0, C = 0.5, support radius 2).

   This project does NOT link against or include any code from mpv (GPL-2.0+)
   or libplacebo (LGPL-2.1). They were consulted only as algorithm references
   and used offline as comparison baselines during research.
